      "category": null,
      "subheading": "TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Under this program, our payments to these factories are adjusted for rate fluctuations in the basket of currencies (\"factory currency exposure index\") in which the labor, materials and overhead costs incurred by the factories in the production of NIKE branded products (\"factory input costs\") are denominated.",
      "char_start": 47687,
      "char_end": 47996,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          48219,
          48528
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 355,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "b2141339-4c5e-4735-ad95-02544923e19f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[384]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260531.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "df1a73ec-5efa-5310-addb-01e7585bc2fd"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000088",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "ad991d0a-b082-4963-9050-b5917cb95d47",
      "section_key": "part-ii-item-7",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "As an offset to the impacts of the fluctuating U.S. Dollar on our non-functional currency denominated product purchases described above, a strengthening U.S. Dollar against the foreign currencies within the factory currency exposure indices reduces NIKE's U.S. Dollar inventory cost.",
      "char_start": 47998,
      "char_end": 48281,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          48530,
          48813
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 356,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "b2141339-4c5e-4735-ad95-02544923e19f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[384]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260531.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "f577f59d-30d1-508e-a61a-08c6e8fe5160"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000088",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "ad991d0a-b082-4963-9050-b5917cb95d47",
      "section_key": "part-ii-item-7",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Conversely, a weakening U.S. Dollar against the indexed foreign currencies increases our inventory cost.",
      "char_start": 48282,
      "char_end": 48386,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          48814,
          48918
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 356,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "b2141339-4c5e-4735-ad95-02544923e19f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[384]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260531.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
      "unit_id": "429973fb-096f-5195-af93-6e240f089be1"
    },
    {
      "accession_number": "0000320187-26-000088",
      "ticker": "NKE",
      "form": "10-K",
      "section_id": "ad991d0a-b082-4963-9050-b5917cb95d47",
      "section_key": "part-ii-item-7",
      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "TRANSACTIONAL EXPOSURES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Non-Functional Currency Denominated External Sales — A portion of our NIKE Brand and Converse revenues associated with European operations are earned in currencies other than the Euro (e.g., the British Pound) but are recognized at a subsidiary that uses the Euro as its functional currency.",
      "char_start": 48389,
      "char_end": 48680,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          48921,
          49212
        ]
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 357,
      "prefilter": null,
      "rule_heading": null,
      "risk_summary": false,
      "processing_set_id": "b2141339-4c5e-4735-ad95-02544923e19f",
      "source_locator": {
        "xpath": "/html/body/div[384]",
        "source_file": "nke-20260531.htm"
      },
      "segmentation_version": "kelly_sentence_v3",
